4
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.815
Tera.

5
00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.320
Nii sai.

6
00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.550
Võib-olla lavaka ajal

7
00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.460
