48
00:11:26.679 --> 00:11:29.354
Väikese maa on hallik jõge.

49
00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.410
Suvenäed.

50
00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.270
Suvrõõm.

51
00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.620
Ei sügist.

52
00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.050
Joala

53
00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.870
