käima ka vene rahvast astist ka.

60
00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.930
Mis on laulja puhul muidugi?

61
00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:15.840
Hädavajalik.

62
00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:20.410
Aga samal ajal asi,
