96
00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.795
Elu ei ole see, mida,

97
00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:19.300
Oma teel iga mees seisab enese eest.

98
00:24:46.420 --> 00:24:48.330
Jäta.

99
00:24:48.430 --> 00:24:51.005
Mi te pole seegi pätse.

100
00:25:53.700 --> 00:25:57.150
Mis need sulle mängib,
